OL,3,GNEWSAFirst patient has surgery at      
OL,4,A#41.5m cancer centre                   
OL,6,FThe first patient to undergo surgery at
OL,7,Fa new #41.5m cancer and surgery centre 
OL,8,Fwhich opened in Surrey earlier this    
OL,9,Fmonth says she feels "enormously       
OL,10,Fprivileged" by the milestone.          
OL,12,FA new Cancer and Surgical Innovation   
OL,13,FCentre at the Royal Surrey County      
OL,14,FHospital in Guildford includes six     
OL,15,Foperating theatres, a short stay ward  
OL,16,Fand specialist facilities.             
OL,23,APub: 21-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
