OL,3,GNEWSAFirst patient has surgery at      
OL,4,A#41.5m cancer centre                   
OL,6,FThe Royal Surrey NHS Foundation Trust  
OL,7,Fsaid the facility will help it perform 
OL,8,Fabout 7,000 more operations a year,    
OL,9,Fstarting with 74-year-old Avril        
OL,10,FMcWhinnie who has had a lump in her    
OL,11,Fbreast removed.                        
OL,13,FShe said: "As soon as I felt the lump, 
OL,14,FI knew in my heart it was cancer and   
OL,15,Fwhen the diagnosis came, I was         
OL,16,Fdesperate to have it removed."         
